line	<str>Scan with the Commorb v2 to acquire the door transcription (make sure you have one free inventory space).</str>
line	
line	<str>Pick up a dead sea slug just west of the imposing door. (If you do not pick up the dead sea slug, you will not be able to talk to Jorral).</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Jorral in the outpost (necklace of passage) north-west of Ardougne. if Making History has not been started.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Col. O'Niall.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Brother Maledict.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the mayor's house and search the study desk until you get a page.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Ezekial Lovecraft in the fishing store (make sure you have one free inventory space).</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Col. O'Niall (make sure you have 3 free inventory spaces)</str>
line	
line	<str>Use swamp paste on one of the fragments. Savant will stop you.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Jeb (near Holgart) and travel to the Fishing Platform.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Bailey on the south-west part Fishing Platform, give him the dead slug.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the sea slug glue on a fragment, then solve the puzzle.</str>
line	
line	<str>Right click the pages and select shape-options on the pages to shape essence into air, water, fire, earth, and mind.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the chiselled stones on their respective Runic altar. It is recommended to bring extra rune essence in case they are destroyed.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Use the handmade runes on the imposing door in the cave underneath Witchaven. Make sure to bring the Commorb with you.</col>
